{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_34_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_34","textTraditional":"一、五年，春王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_34_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_34","textTraditional":"二、夏，夫人姜氏如齊師。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_34_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_34","textTraditional":"三、秋，倪黎來來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_34_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_34","textTraditional":"倪者何？小邾婁也。小邾婁則曷為謂之倪？未能以其名通也。黎來者何？名也。其名何？微國也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_34_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_34","textTraditional":"四、冬，公會齊人、宋人、陳人、蔡人伐衞。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_34_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_34","textTraditional":"此伐衞何？納朔也。曷為不言納衞侯朔？辟王也。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}